{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2021-06-08 12:30:00', 'title': 'WABTEC BEGINS OPERATIONS AT NEIGHBORHOOD 91 ADDITIVE HUB', 'text': "PITTSBURGH, JUNE 08, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- WABTEC CORPORATION\xa0(NYSE: WAB) CELEBRATED TODAY THE START OF OPERATIONS AT NEIGHBORHOOD 91, THE ADDITIVE MANUFACTURING PRODUCTION CAMPUS AT PITTSBURGH INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT'S INNOVATION CAMPUS. THE NEW 11,000-SQ-FT FACILITY BUILDS UPON WABTEC'S EFFORTS TO DRIVE INNOVATION IN THE RAIL INDUSTRY THROUGH ITS GROWING ADDITIVE MANUFACTURING CAPABILITIES."}